		font-size: 22rpx;
		color: #9aa3af;
	}
	.range-row {
		flex-direction: row;
		align-items: center;
		margin-top: 4rpx;
	}
	.range-chip {
		flex-direction: row;
		align-items: center;
		padding: 8rpx 16rpx;
		background-color: #eef0f3;
		border-radius: 8rpx;
		margin-left: 10rpx;
	}
	.range-on {
		background-color: #e8f0fe;
	}
